# No secrets are required for this build.
# Road graph: public OpenStreetMap Overpass API instances (called from the browser, no key).
# Map tiles: tile.openstreetmap.org (no key; attribution shown; no bulk prefetch).
# Place search: nominatim.openstreetmap.org (no key; explicit search only).
# If a licensed/keyed provider is approved later, put browser-safe public keys in
# VITE_* variables restricted by origin, and confidential keys only in Vercel
# server environment variables used by a bounded server function (none exists yet).
